| info =
*Volt expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''25''' [[energy]] to energize the surrounding area, increasing the mobility of himself and his allies within {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''25''' meters. Affected players will gain {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''10% / 15% / 20% / 25%''' weapon [[Reload Speed]] and {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''75%''' melee [[Attack Speed]] and [[Movement Speed]] bonuses, lasting for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''9 / 10 / 11 / 12''' seconds.
**The movement speed increase is capped at '''<u>150%</u>''' for allied players; there is no cap for the Volt who cast the ability, nor any cap for non-player entities such as NPCs.
***Allies can [[Maneuvers#Backspring|backflip]] to remove Speed if they wish to opt-out.
**The movement speed buff stacks additively with other movement speed modifiers. (e.g., {{M|Dispatch Overdrive}} combined with Speed at max rank and +30% Ability Strength from {{M|Intensify}} will increase Volt's move speed by {{Math|{{A|Speed|75%}} {{mul}} {{M|Intensify|1.3}} + {{M|Dispatch Overdrive|60%}}|mt=y|percent=y}}).
**The attack speed buff stacks additively with other attack speed modifiers. (e.g., {{M|Fury}} combined with Speed at max rank and +30% Ability Strength will increase Volt's attack speed by {{Math|{{A|Speed|75%}} {{mul}} {{M|Intensify|1.3}} + {{M|Fury|30%}}|mt=y|percent=y}}).
**The reload speed buff stacks additively with other reload speed modifiers. (e.g., {{M|Quickdraw}} combined with Speed at max rank and +30% Ability Strength from {{M|Intensify}} will increase Volt's reload speed by {{Math|{{A|Speed|25%}} {{mul}} {{M|Intensify|1.3}} + {{M|Quickdraw|48%}}|mt=y|percent=y}}).
*Increases the distance of [[maneuvers]] like the sliding, front flip, and wall run as a result of the faster movement speed.
*Can be used while performing many actions without interrupting them, including [[reload|reloading]].
*Can be recast while active.
| augment = [[File:ShockingSpeedMod.png|200px|left]]
